    {
      "occurrence": 35,
      "number": 116,
      "number_raw": "116",
      "source_number": "116",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "This is the birthplace of the superior race! This is the womb from# which the armies of god will strike from! From the flesh of the weak comes# the next race of man. Those who survive the dip will become the soldiers of god,# and with their hands we shall shape the Unity.",
      "source_text": "This is the birthplace of the superior race! This is the womb from\n# which the armies of god will strike from! From the flesh of the weak comes\n# the next race of man. Those who survive the dip will become the soldiers of god,\n# and with their hands we shall shape the Unity.",
      "source_line_start": 54,
      "source_line_end": 57,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 36,
      "number": 116,
      "number_raw": "116",
      "source_number": "116",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这里是优越种族的诞生地。这里是神之战士的出击地！弱小的人类将在此演化至新的一代。那些浸泡之后仍能生存下来的人将会成为神的战士，他们将会铸造一个“同一”！",
      "source_text": "这里是优越种族的诞生地。这里是神之战士的出击地！弱小的人类将在此演化至新的一代。那些浸泡之后仍能生存下来的人将会成为神的战士，他们将会铸造一个“同一”！",
      "source_line_start": 58,
      "source_line_end": 58,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
