      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你们是怎么运作的？",
      "source_text": "你们是怎么运作的？",
      "source_line_start": 64,
      "source_line_end": 64,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 41,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You will be bound in the holy restraints. We will lower you into a# vat of the blood of god, the holiest of holies. The FEV will shape and change# you. You will be strong. You become a Nightkin if you are fortunate and# worthy of the honor, else you will die the most painful death possible. Soon, I# will be honored. I will become strong. Then I will fear no man.",
      "source_text": "You will be bound in the holy restraints. We will lower you into a\n# vat of the blood of god, the holiest of holies. The FEV will shape and change\n# you. You will be strong. You become a Nightkin if you are fortunate and\n# worthy of the honor, else you will die the most painful death possible. Soon, I\n# will be honored. I will become strong. Then I will fear no man.",
      "source_line_start": 66,
      "source_line_end": 70,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 42,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你会被神圣之缚包围，然后被浸泡到最最神圣的神血池。FEV会改变你的肌体，你会变得更加强壮。如果你受到神的眷顾，就会幸运地成为夜行团的一员，否则就会以最痛苦的形势死去。很快，我就会受到神恩了，我会变壮，我将不再惧怕任何人类！",
      "source_text": "你会被神圣之缚包围，然后被浸泡到最最神圣的神血池。FEV会改变你的肌体，你会变得更加强壮。如果你受到神的眷顾，就会幸运地成为夜行团的一员，否则就会以最痛苦的形势死去。很快，我就会受到神恩了，我会变壮，我将不再惧怕任何人类！",
